    hasChoices: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: Hi Professor Servus.
      jumpToLineInSameDialogue: 0
      targetLineIndex: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  - line: 'Servus: Rest assured, however, it will only take us 3 days to resolve
      the matter.'
    hasChoices: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: Hi Professor Servus.
      jumpToLineInSameDialogue: 0
      targetLineIndex: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  - line: "Servus: I\u2019ll leave you two informed when there's new information.
      Have a nice day."
    hasChoices: 0
